== Usage ==

Use this infobox at the start of a levequest page. All fields are optional,
and blank fields hide their rows. It matches [[Template:Action]],
[[Template:Item]], [[Template:Mob]], and [[Template:Status Effect]].

<pre>
{{Levequest
| type =
| rank =
| aspect =
| location =
| authority =
| issuer =
}}
</pre>

* <code>type</code>: Battlecraft, Fieldcraft, Faction, or Grand Company, determined by the leve's ID band in the client's guildleve table.
* <code>rank</code>: the rank at which the leve is offered.
* <code>location</code>: the aetherial gate where the levequest starts.
* <code>authority</code>: the Adventurers' Guild that issues the leve.
* <code>issuer</code>: the NPC at that guild's leve counter.

<code>aspect</code> names the guardian's virtue associated with the guildleve,
such as Valor, Piety, Tenacity, or Munificence. The client sheets do not name
it. Use the 1.x reference when it supplies a name; otherwise leave the field
blank.
